&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_3908-819x1024.jpg" alt="Tres noies somriuen i sostenen ventalls oberts en un carreró de pedra de Barcelona." width="819" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
